et lost and sometimes stubborn as they learn how to walk.\nBut you'll be able to save all the slippers.\n\nA new concept of shooting puzzle game.\nIt is a shooting puzzle game that makes a way for AI characters wandering in a maze to move easily and safely.\n\n100 stages with various solutions.\nVarious maze shapes, slippers, objects, and daemons are combined, so each stage can be played differently each time.", "short_description": "Save the slippers that are hanging in the maze of nightmares!"}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "\uba54\uc778(2)1440_1440(211029) \ud55c\uae00.png", "id": "843670026323221", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974680_843670029656554_4170918606599011011_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=HEWTjj8BY-4Q7kNvwG-R_ZM&_nc_oc=AdootUwwIRQpLs4BQ_jADs1Hdem_t30ZcDvjRrx8P2vZuWV9Q92G3Z4kAN6zjXi54NA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Af2iz-DBScyHVM4BpElqDowoH-Y559JWAs9juFsW-8j2kA&oe=69F0B89F"}, {"file_name": "\uba54\uc778(\uc2dc\uc5482)2560_1440(211029) \ud55c\uae00.png", "id": "627571058261409", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39036641_627571061594742_7128199620299863828_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=zLfZNyFWrb0Q7kNvwE7_Q8g&_nc_oc=AdrwLga9F-mP7g9iEdLhpkAaFYFyK36P3BZk9sD3v3xQ8ozrZXAVHtjSca74I0Y2leU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Af3VX95BsTq6PDtjoRtSGB2eED4oHt3V5hwyz8jOyohJdQ&oe=69F0B487"}, {"file_name": "app_logo.png", "id": "583935226146634", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75223477_583935232813300_935540870816570877_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ZQZNFjE9MtsQ7kNvwHg0JmZ&_nc_oc=AdoDeEYahSPis8WQyedGNYb7WEdGov9q8F_t7L6vIV5Z6P-4GxgfTmujJfQJyGcBhGE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Af2jlIZptTC89JzbqeAx3Q0zotxwrEKFCYP35xW-MgUplQ&oe=69F0B8D7"}, {"file_name": "